    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī yenīyo niigwa ilaka itaale gītī ly'ibita itaale lya ng'wigūlū līlīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bongeja kūhaya hangī gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Banamhala makūmi abīlī na bane, nī Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine būgwa balīnamya Mulungu ūyo igashije hī Isumbi lya būtemi, kūnū balīhaya; “Alichene, Halelūya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būkombe bo Ng'wana wa Ng'holo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna liza ilaka kūfuma a hī Isumbi lya būtemi līlīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī niigwa ilaka gītī ly'ibita itaale,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūniwīla, “Andīkaga gīkī, ‘Balī na lubango abo balaalīkilwe kūja kū shigukulu sha būtooji bo Ng'wana wa Ng'holo.’” Hama ūniwīla hangī gīkī, “Ī yenīyī mihayo ya ng'wa Mulungu, īlī ya ng'hana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūgwa kū magūlū gakwe gīkī naanamye; alīyo ūniwīla, “Lekaga ū kwīta gīko, nū nene nalī ntūmami ng'wiyo dūhū, hamò na a badūgū bako abo balī na būkaanīji bo ng'wa Yesu. Namyage Mulungu, nguno ū būkaanīji bo ng'wa Yesu gūlī moyo gwa būhangi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Falasa yape na Ndamhīji wayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nataalī nalolile kwimanīla nabona haalugūka hangī ū ng'wigūlū, na falasa yape yīmīīlaga, ūyo walī ayīdamhīlile akitanagwa Nsanyiwa, nīyo h'ūyo alī Ng'hana yenekīlī; ūyo kalamulīle na kalwīle kakwe mu būlūgū kalī ka būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A miso gakwe gaalī gītī ndali ja moto, ū kū ntwe gokwe jalīho ngikili ningī; walī andīkilwe lina īlo atīho munhū wa kūlīmana, ūlū atī wei ng'wenekīlī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī azwalile shizwalo shidabbiwe mu mininga; ī lina lyakwe akitanagwa Mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabita ga bashilikale ba ng'wigūlū ganondeelaga gadamhīlile falasa jape, hangī gazwalile shizwalo shawiza sha kitaani yape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nomo gokwe lyafumaga mo līlūshū lyūgī lya kūbūlagīla mahanga; na hangī akūbadīīma na nang'ha gwa chūma, na akūlīpandagīla ī likamīlo lya mvinya ya būkalī na būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu wa būdūla bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha shizwalo shakwe na a h'itango walī andīkilwe ī lina lyakwe; gīkī, NTEMI WA BATEMI, NA SEEBA WA BASEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūmona na malaika wīmīīlaga ha līīmi alījihamukīla pyī ī noni ījo jikalalaga ng'wigūlya, alījiwīla gīkī, “Ikumingagi ng'wize kū shigukulu shitaale, shigukulu sha ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzūgi mulye nyama ja mibīlī ya batemi, na ya bataale ba bashilikale, na banhū ba nguzu; na nyama ja falasa na badamhīji bajo, na nyama ja mibīlī ya banhū bose, babize balī mu wiyabī nūūlū mu būsese, bado na bataale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nībona ī shiinū, na a batemi ba mu sī na a mabita gabo. Baalī bikuminga kwilwisha būlūgū nang'hwe ūyo walī adamhīlile falasa nī libita lya bashilikale bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūding'wa ī shiinū, hamò nū ng'hangi ū nomolomo, ūyo yantūmaga kūja wīta shimanīkījo akūbalembagūlaga a balamya ba shiikolile, abo baalī banukūla lūmeng'ho lwayo ī shiinū. A babīlī benabo būponyiwa balī bapanga gīko, mu nyanza ya moto ūyo gūkūbakaga na būgota bo shibiliti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bangī bene ūbabūlaga ūyo walī adamhīlile falasa; akababūlaga na līlūshū īlo lyafumaga mu nomo gokwe. Pyī ī noni jikalya jilile ī mibimba yabo, jigūta!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
